1
00:00:00,151 --> 00:00:02,101
(Bert:)Hear, hear.
Cheers.

2
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:05,823
(Mrs Petrescu:)Cheers. Filmed before
a live studio audience.

3
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:12,950
(Leonard:)And that is how a short
asthmatic scientist

4
00:00:12,947 --> 00:00:15,577
(Leonard:)landed a stone cold fox.

5
00:00:15,583 --> 00:00:17,583
(Awkward guy:)Oh. Whoa.

6
00:00:19,337 --> 00:00:21,617
(Awkward guy:)I didn't know you can
propose to the same person

7
00:00:21,622 --> 00:00:23,672
(Awkward guy:)so many times.

8
00:00:23,674 --> 00:00:26,254
(Leonard:)The third time,
I did it in skywriting,

9
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,880
(Leonard:)but she never looked up.

10
00:00:28,679 --> 00:00:30,429
(Penny:)You know, once,
I proposed to him.

11
00:00:30,431 --> 00:00:32,381
(Leonard:)Yeah. I said no.

12
00:00:32,383 --> 00:00:33,713
(Leonard:)Why?

13
00:00:33,718 --> 00:00:35,938
(Leonard:)I just wanted to
make her work for it.

14
00:00:36,721 --> 00:00:39,641
(Penny:)Yeah, that's gonna
cost you later.

15
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,640
(Red-haired guy:)Hang on. Is she just with
you because you're rich?

16
00:00:42,643 --> 00:00:44,563
(Leonard:)She makes more
money than I do!

17
00:00:44,562 --> 00:00:46,942
What?! Who are you?!

18
00:00:55,828 --> 00:00:57,908
(Sheldon:)Do you know
what else I love about you?

19
00:00:57,913 --> 00:00:58,963
(Sheldon:)Hmm?

20
00:00:58,964 --> 00:01:03,084
Y-Your handwriting
is impeccable!

